stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ActiveFrame: stamp only crosses the work queue
    ActiveFrame --> Acquire: deadline and owner still current
    ActiveFrame --> Held: expired before execution
    Acquire --> DbPending: physical try-lock, no Source mutex
    DbPending --> DbPending: request never replies
    DbPending --> DbPending: input / clear / cancel arrives
    DbPending --> Hung: before or timeout removed
    Hung --> Hung
    DbPending --> Recheck: reply before shared deadline
    DbPending --> Released: 3s slice or 9s pass elapsed
    Recheck --> Publish: same owner/nonce/epoch, CAS Written
    Recheck --> Released: stale or cancelled
    Publish --> [*]: same-frame file transaction, drop guard
    Released --> Retry: read only, failures below 3 and time remains
    Retry --> Acquire: fresh observation, no renewed pass deadline
    Released --> Indeterminate: CAS, one request, nonce preserved
    Indeterminate --> Indeterminate: server may commit late
    Released --> Yield: input/front/epoch changed
    Released --> Notice: 9s exhausted
    Indeterminate --> Notice
    Notice --> [*]: outbox within 1s
    Notice --> NoticeDebt: unavailable, not notified success
    Yield --> [*]: original and intent remain owned
    NoticeDebt --> [*]
